    "source": {
      "value": "da"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "This wine, prepared using the blood of a creature with overwhelming vitality, soothes the body, mind, and spirit with a temporary sense of euphoria and rest. When you drink wine of the blood, you recover 2d10 Hit Points.\n\nAdditionally, the wine attempts to counteract every negative emotion effect affecting you, with a counteract level of 3 and a counteract modifier of +9. Lastly, you gain a +1 status bonus to all Will saves, or a +2 status bonus against emotion effects, for 1 minute.\n\nActivate (1 Action); Components Interact"
    },
